        "csrc/fused/sm_90/fused_decoder_megakernel.cuh (P2 reduce-order ~:245-273, P2.4 SAM, P2.5 clip, P2.6 d-reduce; ~6 one-line guards) and the mirrored twins csrc/fused/sm_90/fused_vit_megakernel.cuh + csrc/fused/sm_90/fused_mamba_megakernel.cuh",
        "csrc/fused/sm_90/opt_stages_precompute.cuh (guard muon NS stage + sg11/sg15 mu precompute bodies; ~3 lines)",
        "csrc/fused/sm_90/opt_stage_supergrok2.cuh (sg2_stage_segmented_sort identity-perm guard; ~2 lines)",
        "tuning/decoder_bench.py + tuning/vit_bench.py + a mamba bench twin (accept ablate_token kwarg -> append -DSG_ABLATE=<token> to extra_cuda_cflags; ~2 lines each)",
